{"ts":"2026-08-31T18:45:46.461Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"dbc66168f2f6c4fd70895efe","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null},"op":"update","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"Done: pinned @unbrained/pm-cli at 2026.8.31, repaired the drifted ops-w3ke history stream hash, and reinstalled the pm-ops self-extension against the new binary. Updated the compatibility-floor test's REQUIRED_DEVELOPMENT_VERSION to match the new pin. pm health --strict-exit is green; changed files: .agents/pm/history/ops-w3ke.jsonl, package.json, package-lock.json, test/compatibility-floor.test.ts; no .toon payloads modified."},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T18:45:46.461Z"}],"before_hash":"6bffa6b1b406b10757b7ba408931bb41d1efb507415d1410cb3f9a0ef937ece8","after_hash":"bdd4f55aaa9553f6e137f86536bf67e5728eed534f143b37d4c624d84782d480","item_hash_version":3}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T19:32:42.640Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"2e37782ad60a9b8410683521","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-08-31T19:32:42.640Z","author":"claude","text":"The bump also cost two branches of index.ts their coverage, which the 100/100/100/100 per-file gate caught: the undefined arm of describeDecisionValue and the empty-decisions fallback in renderMergeReceiptsMarkdown. Cause: the test that covered them worked by hand-editing decision values into a receipt file under .git/pm-merge-receipts, and pm 2026.8.31 no longer reflects an edited value back out. It reports a pm_value_hash instead, while an untouched lab receipt still renders its real retained and discarded values. That reads as integrity checking rather than a loss of detail, so the receipt report is not degraded for genuine merges."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T19:32:42.640Z"}],"before_hash":"bdd4f55aaa9553f6e137f86536bf67e5728eed534f143b37d4c624d84782d480","after_hash":"1dd9ef788eae90bcb01195d888fb04b8ab28cdadd55ec8babb98fec9dd04298a","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
{"ts":"2026-08-31T19:32:43.131Z","author":"claude","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_instance":"2e37782ad60a9b8410683521","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-31T19:32:43.131Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-31T19:32:43.131Z","author":"claude","text":"The guards were kept and the test was replaced, not the other way round. Deleting an unreachable branch to satisfy a coverage gate removes behaviour that a receipt from an older merge driver still needs. Instead renderMergeReceiptsMarkdown is exported and driven directly with typed fixtures, which covers all four rendering behaviours (absent value renders as a dash, structured value renders as compact JSON, an over-long value truncates without leaving an odd backslash that would escape the next pipe, and a decision-less receipt still gets a row) without depending on CLI receipt-file internals that just proved they can change. It also drops a four second lab build from the suite."}]}],"before_hash":"1dd9ef788eae90bcb01195d888fb04b8ab28cdadd55ec8babb98fec9dd04298a","after_hash":"6b695fe5a5d55ab1dcee531a7eb2b80f5fc1260415a317980f90837b89eab12c","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"failed","reason":"resolver_failed","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}}}
